sequenceDiagram
  actor User as Authenticated user
  participant Portal as Web portal
  participant Auth as Auth service
  participant Consent as RGPD consent store

  User->>Portal: Submit credentials
  Portal->>Auth: Authenticate user
  Auth->>Consent: Check first-login RGPD acceptance
  alt consent missing
    Auth-->>Portal: Require RGPD acceptance
    Portal-->>User: Show RGPD terms screen
    User->>Portal: Accept RGPD terms
    Portal->>Consent: Persist acceptance
    Consent-->>Portal: Acceptance stored
    Portal-->>User: Continue into application
  else consent already stored
    Auth-->>Portal: Allow access
    Portal-->>User: Enter application
  end